      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Ignis (Son of Balian & Ysela) / Aleksandar (Kadan's Father) / Elwin (Kadan's Mother)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Ignis · Aleksandar · Elwin · Balian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 1 forward.",
