      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Hercul (Surviving Paladin of the Holy Order) / Gawain (Leader of the Seven Pursuers) / Rondol (Heavy shield knight of the Seven Pursuers)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Hercul · Gawain · Rondol · Grimli] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 2 forward.",
