      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Gawain (Leader of the Seven Pursuers) / Rondol (Heavy shield knight of the Seven Pursuers) / Grimli (Dwarf brawler of the Seven Pursuers)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Gawain · Rondol · Grimli · Kaze] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 3 forward.",
      "dialogueQuoteKo": "“지금이야... 에일라, 그림리... 이번에는 서로의 숨소리를 듣고 움직여라!” “일곱 추적자 놈들... 오늘의 피는 너희의 목숨으로 반드시 되갚아 주마!”",
