      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Kadan (Protagonist) / Aleksandar (Kadan's Father) / Elwin (Kadan's Mother)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Kadan · Aleksandar · Elwin] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 4 forward.",
