          "narrationEn": "\"You did well, Kadan. A heart that honors life possesses greater power than any spell. Your father Aleksandar always remembered the warmth of life he swore to protect before ever drawing his blades.\"",
          "speakerKo": "엘윈",
          "speakerEn": "Elwin",
          "dialogueKo": "“착하구나, 카단. 생명을 귀하게 여기는 마음이야말로 그 어떤 마법보다 위대한 힘이란다. 네 아버지 알렉산다르 역시 무기를 휘두를 때마다 지켜야 할 생명의 온기를 먼저 생각하셨단다.”",
          "dialogueEn": "\"You did well, Kadan. A heart that honors life possesses greater power than any spell. Your father Aleksandar always remembered the warmth of life he swore to protect before ever drawing his blades.\""
