          "narrationEn": "\"Will I ever become a steadfast shield like father, protecting those who stand behind me?\"",
          "speakerKo": "엘윈",
          "speakerEn": "Elwin",
          "dialogueKo": "“저도 언젠가는 아버지처럼 등 뒤의 사람들을 지키는 튼튼한 방패가 될 수 있을까요?”",
          "dialogueEn": "\"Will I ever become a steadfast shield like father, protecting those who stand behind me?\""
