          "dialogueEn": "Scooping up handfuls of frozen shale and ice chunks, Kadan hurled them with pinpoint force into the eyes of the charging steeds. As the warhorses reared in confusion, Kadan seized the groaning Gilgamesh and threw the boy onto his own back."
