      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Kadan (Protagonist) / Celia (Heroine) / Ignis (Son of Balian & Ysela)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Kadan · Celia · Ignis · Balian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 10 forward.",
