          "imageUrl": "/images/webtoon/episode_10/scene_21.webp",
          "narrationKo": "카단은 피가 배어 나오도록 입술을 깨물며 방패를 거두었다. 그의 맑은 눈동자에 붉은 궁정의 화염이 칼날처럼 비쳤다.",
          "narrationEn": "Biting his lip until crimson welled upon his chin, Kadan lowered his shield. Within his clear eyes, the dancing fire of the Red Palace reflected like keen blades.",
          "speakerKo": "내레이션",
