          "narrationEn": "Thousands of emaciated prisoners interned in this subterranean abyss bore no names, answered only to blunt serial numerals stamped upon heavy iron collars. And swung rusted pickaxes from dawn to dusk to unearth crimson firestones, gradually stripped of every sacred memory of their mortal lives. Princess Cilia positioned the tip of her jade staff against the cavern floor.",
