      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Balian (Ignis's Father) / Kadan (Protagonist) / Gawain (Leader of the Seven Pursuers)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Balian · Kadan · Gawain · Rondol] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 11 forward.",
