          "narrationKo": "그 비극을 멈춘 것은 늙은 성기사 발리안이었다. 발리안이 쇠창대로 부서진 성소 바닥을 강하게 내리찍어 거대한 균열을 일으키며 두 진영을 갈라놓았다.",
          "narrationEn": "It was the aging Paladin Balian who brought an end to the madness. Balian slammed his heavy spear shaft into the cracked flagstones of the ruined shrine, splitting the ground between the opposing forces with a resonant boom.",
          "speakerKo": "내레이션",
          "speakerEn": "Narration",
          "dialogueKo": "그 비극을 멈춘 것은 늙은 성기사 발리안이었다. 발리안이 쇠창대로 부서진 성소 바닥을 강하게 내리찍어 거대한 균열을 일으키며 두 진영을 갈라놓았다.",
          "dialogueEn": "It was the aging Paladin Balian who brought an end to the madness. Balian slammed his heavy spear shaft into the cracked flagstones of the ruined shrine, splitting the ground between the opposing forces with a resonant boom."
