          "imageUrl": "/images/webtoon/episode_12/scene_18.webp",
          "narrationKo": "그림리가 거대한 무쇠 모루 망치를 계단 석판에 쾅 내려찍으며 우렁차게 포효했다.",
          "narrationEn": "Grimli slammed his massive iron anvil hammer against the stone flagstones, his voice echoing like rolling thunder.",
          "speakerKo": "내레이션",
          "speakerEn": "Narration",
          "dialogueKo": "그림리가 거대한 무쇠 모루 망치를 계단 석판에 쾅 내려찍으며 우렁차게 포효했다.",
          "dialogueEn": "Grimli slammed his massive iron anvil hammer against the stone flagstones, his voice echoing like rolling thunder."
