      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Kadan (Protagonist) / Aleksandar (Kadan's Father) / Leonar (Master of the Jade Staff)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Kadan · Aleksandar · Leonar] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 13 forward.",
      "dialogueQuoteKo": "“배를 채웠으니 밥값을 해야지. 애송이, 그 낡은 방패를 들어라. 네놈의 어깨가 대지의 무게를 견딜 수 있는지 시험해 보겠다!” “좋다! 힘으로 맞서지 않고 자연의 결을 따라 흘려보내는 솜씨가 제법이구나. 옛 성기사단의 수호벽과 바람섬의 유려함이 한 몸에 깃들어 있어. 알렉산다르 형님이 살아서 이 모습을 보았다면 껄껄 웃으며 술잔을 기울였을 게다.”",
      "dialogueQuoteEn": "“A warrior must earn his supper. Boy, raise that battered lid upon your arm. Let us see if those northern shoulders can endure the weight of the earth!” “Splendid! To turn aside brute force along the natural grain rather than meeting it head-on... You bear the steadfast aegis of the Holy Order and the fluid grace of the Wind Isle in a single vessel. Had Brother Aleksandar lived to witness this, he would have emptied his flagon in roaring joy.”",
