      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Leonar (Master of the Jade Staff) / Celia (Heroine) / Rondol (Heavy shield knight of the Seven Pursuers)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Leonar · Celia · Rondol] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 14 forward.",
