      "dialogueQuoteEn": "“What are those monumental stone complexes resting beneath the lake bed? It appears as though an entire imperial metropolis was swallowed whole.” “A thousand years ago, this was the heart of Aquaria, the glorious capital of an ancient water-magic civilization. When the forbidden mana within the Nine Shadows Codex spiraled out of control, the entire realm sank into the abyss in a single night. Those seventy-two basalt monoliths we must navigate were once the immense pillars supporting the imperial palaces.”",
