      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Leonar (Master of the Jade Staff) / Celia (Heroine) / Kadan (Protagonist)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Leonar · Celia · Kadan · Lucian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 15 forward.",
