          "narrationKo": "바람 속삭임 섬으로 출항하기 전날 밤, 며칠 동안 안개 호수를 무겁게 짓누르던 짙은 유백색 물안개가 한순간 거짓말처럼 걷혀 나갔다.",
          "narrationEn": "On the eve of their voyage to Whispering Wind Island, the dense, milky-white fog that had weighed upon Mist Lake for days lifted as if by magic.",
          "speakerKo": "내레이션",
