      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Celia (Heroine) / Ignis (Son of Balian & Ysela) / Aleksandar (Kadan's Father)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Celia · Ignis · Aleksandar · Balian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 16 forward.",
