          "dialogueEn": "Rondol stroked his briny gray beard, letting out a booming belly laugh. \"Ha! The northern wolf knows how to stoke the embers in an old sea dog's chest! So be it! This pegleg will prove that an old sailor's blood has not turned to bilge water!\""
