      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Aleksandar (Kadan's Father) / Celia (Heroine) / Balian (Ignis's Father)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Aleksandar · Celia · Balian · Lucian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 18 forward.",
