      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Kadan (Protagonist) / Celia (Heroine) / Aleksandar (Kadan's Father)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Kadan · Celia · Aleksandar · Balian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 23 forward.",
