      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Ignis (Son of Balian & Ysela) / Kadan (Protagonist) / Balian (Ignis's Father)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Ignis · Kadan · Balian · Lucian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 23 forward.",
