      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Kadan (Protagonist) / Celia (Heroine) / Balian (Ignis's Father)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Kadan · Celia · Balian · Gawain] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 24 forward.",
