      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Celia (Heroine) / Kadan (Protagonist) / Ignis (Son of Balian & Ysela)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Celia · Kadan · Ignis · Aleksandar] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 27 forward.",
      "dialogueQuoteKo": "“당신은 항상 다른 사람들의 약속만을 짊어지고 있어요. 당신 자신을 위한 소원은 어디에 있나요?” “북극성이 오늘 밤 유난히 맑게 빛나네요. 폭풍우가 지나간 뒤의 하늘은 언제나 거짓 없이 깨끗한 법이에요.”",
      "dialogueQuoteEn": "“I was thinking of the sacred vows I pledged to Master Aleksandar. That steel is never an instrument of dominion, but a shield to dry the tears of the suffering. And... the fraternal oath I shared with Ignis.” “You constantly shoulder the covenants of others, Kadan. Where does your own heart's longing reside?”",
