      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Celia (Heroine) / Kadan (Protagonist) / Aleksandar (Kadan's Father)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Celia · Kadan · Aleksandar · Gawain] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 34 forward.",
