      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Celia (Heroine) / Kadan (Protagonist) / Elwin (Kadan's Mother)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Celia · Kadan · Elwin · Lucian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 36 forward.",
