          "narrationEn": "Steadying his resolve against the biting night gale. Through the chilled fog drifting along the flagstones, the gentle warmth of starlight spirits who had watched over these archives for centuries still lingered. Embedded like luminous constellations into the obsidian walls were the archaic cross-shaped stigmata of the holy order, casting radiant amber beams into the shadows.",
