      "textEn": "\"King Fenrir's loyalty has lifted the burden from our shoulders. Now it is our turn to cleave the tyrant on the throne.\"\n\nSecuring the parchment and the glowing glass ember, the two companions advanced toward the colossal obsidian portal sealing the inner sanctum. From beyond the threshold drifted the choking stench of brimstone and the violent ripples of corrupted mana.\n\nStanding before the stone gate, Kadan hoisted his shield to his chest, its cross-shaped insignia humming in resonance with the parchment's scar.\n\nCilia gripped her jade staff with both hands, standing shoulder-to-shoulder with him.",
