      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Kadan (Protagonist) / Aleksandar (Kadan's Father) / Balian (Ignis's Father)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Kadan · Aleksandar · Balian · Death Knight Artus] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 39 forward.",
