      "sceneExplanationEn": "• Characters & Roles: Kadan (Protagonist) / Ignis (Son of Balian & Ysela) / Death Knight Artus (Regent of the Red Glass Court)\n• Story Comprehension Guide: In this scene, [Kadan · Ignis · Death Knight Artus · Lucian] appear together as key dialogue reveals their inner resolve, emotional conflict, and pivotal clues driving Episode 39 forward.",
